    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a> to parry your opponents' attacks, gaining a +1 deflection bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> against melee attacks until the start of your next turn. You must have your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a> in hand to use this Talent, and you do not gain the deflection bonus if you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> or otherwise unaware of the incoming attack.<br><br>You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, the deflection bonus increases by +1 (to a maximum of +3).",
